# Extra CA certificates for the import fetchers only (IMPORT_CA_BUNDLE,
# docs/data-import.md §3 "TLS"). They are ADDED to the system trust store;
# certificate verification is never turned off.
#
# GeoTrust TLS RSA CA G1 — the public intermediate that issued the
# certificate of arhiva.fzo.org.mk (*.fzo.org.mk). The ФЗОМ server sends a
# different intermediate (GeoTrust EV RSA CA G2), so its chain cannot be
# built without this one (curl: "unable to get local issuer certificate").
#   Subject:  C=US, O=DigiCert Inc, OU=www.digicert.com, CN=GeoTrust TLS RSA CA G1
#   Issuer:   C=US, O=DigiCert Inc, OU=www.digicert.com, CN=DigiCert Global Root G2
#   Valid:    2017-11-02 12:23:37 UTC – 2027-11-02 12:23:37 UTC
#   SHA-256:  C0:6E:30:7F:7C:FC:1D:32:FA:72:A4:C0:33:C8:7B:90:01:9A:F2:16:F0:77:5D:64:97:8A:2E:CA:6C:8A:23:0E
#   SKI:      94:4F:D4:5D:8B:E4:A4:E2:A6:80:FE:FD:D8:F9:00:EF:A3:BE:02:57
#             (= the Authority Key Identifier of the ФЗОМ certificate)
#   Source:   http://cacerts.geotrust.com/GeoTrustTLSRSACAG1.crt (the AIA
#             "CA Issuers" URL in the ФЗОМ certificate), identical to
#             https://cacerts.digicert.com/GeoTrustTLSRSACAG1.crt.pem;
#             retrieved 2026-10-07, chain verified against the system root
#             DigiCert Global Root G2.
# The ФЗОМ host certificate itself expires 2026-11-12; a renewed one may
# come from another intermediate — re-check then (docs/data-import.md).
